From 754922bd52f132ee4e39caeb1cb9823f09f8bd88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Calogero Mandracchia <calogero@efebia.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:38:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] codex-mcp: forward channel notifications of opted-in
 servers to their thread

For a server with channel = true, declare the claude/channel experimental
capability in initialize and, when the server declares it too over a
session with an initialize handshake, forward its notifications/claude/channel
notifications to a bounded per-thread queue that a host can take.
